# No tests

- Never create, generate, restore, or modify automated tests.
- Do not add test files, test fixtures, snapshots, test runners, test scripts, or test-only dependencies.
- Do not add test-related configuration or CI steps.
- Validate changes only with non-test checks such as compilation, type checking, linting, or manual inspection.
